		{
			title: "Light the Dark"
			icon: "createbionics:matchbox_item"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 1.5d
			description: [
				"The Matchbox is a small spider that carries four stacks of torches and sets them down where it is dark."
				"Give it torches, then sneak and right-click to pick a mode: off, caves only, or sun and caves. Leave it to wander and it lights the dark it walks through."
				"Same fuel as the Anole. Andesite alloy, while sneaking, repairs it."
			]
