		{
			title: "Show It an Ore"
			icon: "createbionics:seeker_item"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 3.0d
			description: [
				"The Seeker looks underground for the ore you hand it, digs for a few seconds, and brings the block back."
				"If it finds nothing, it eats the sample. Do not hand it your last diamond. A diamond or netherite pickaxe makes the dig faster."
				"Right-click with an ore starts the search. Hold sneak when you mean to apply a skin instead."
			]
