			y: 6.0d
			description: [
				"The Replete holds 160 buckets of any fluid. Craft the Body on a mechanical crafter and place it. Each Leg is the next piece. You need six."
				"Right-click with a bucket to fill it, or to pour into a tank. If the fluid around it matches what is inside, it drinks that up. Finish the legs before you fill it. Empty it before you take it apart."
